# System: constructive knowledge
#
# The actual metatheory — the logic dregg is a witness OF. Transcribed from
# metatheory/CONSTRUCTIVE-KNOWLEDGE.md (read in full). Candidate-independent
# by design: it would be the metatheory of any system built this way.

#>spw_system_constructive_knowledge
#:system #!form

^"thesis"{
  ~#law: "a principal's authority over a resource is exactly its ability to constructively exhibit a witness the kernel accepts — production under non-forgeability"
  ~#correction: "authority is NOT affine descent — it does not deplete by use; it is constituted by what you can prove, every time, at the point of use; the drain reading forbids exactly the generative patterns that give ocaps their power"
  ~#asymmetry: "proof-checking is cheap and trusted; proof-search is undecidable and untrusted — the whole edifice organizes around this"
  @source: ~"../../metatheory/CONSTRUCTIVE-KNOWLEDGE.md"
}

^"four_knowledges"{
  // the substances, read epistemically
  .{
    value: "conserved knowledge — cannot be created or destroyed, only moved; you cannot know yourself into more money"
    state: "revisable knowledge — a cell's beliefs about itself, nonce as the freshness coordinate"
    authority: "productive knowledge — what this cell can construct a witness for; the others are what is known, this is what can be DONE with what is known"
    evidence: "the constructive-knowledge ledger itself — appending invalidates no prior knowledge, and forgetting is provably NOT a frame-preserving update"
  }
}

^"production_law"{
  ~#gate: "one fail-closed conjunction on every action — WHO the credential verifies, WHAT granted is a genuine subset of held, HOW every caveat discharges and the edge is unrevoked"
  ~#receipt: "a constructive witness in the strictest sense — the post-state projection equals the fold of the trace the verb emitted, computed blind; you cannot witness knowledge you did not construct"
  ~#lightclient: "accept implies a genuine kernel transition exists — the pale ghost, a forged history that type-checks, cannot be produced because its witness does not exist"
  ~#adversary: "a leaked key bounds the attacker to the attenuation-closure of what it stole — the adversary's constructive knowledge is bounded by its theft"
}

^"open_frontier"{
  ~#macaroon_cap: "one authority seen four ways — biscuit policy, macaroon caveat-chain, kernel cap, zk proof — today joined by CONJUNCTION, not a proven arrow; the missing theorem is chainGateG implies capAuthorityG; non-amplification is told twice in two lattices welded by and" =owed
  ~#settlement: "BindsLiveAuthority is a typed hypothesis awaiting its deployed discharge — the same theorem the time-travel and membrane-merge frontiers converge on" =owed
}

^"rename"{
  ~#insight: "the metatheory is the PREDICATE, the verification is the WITNESS — dregg2 is real precisely because it can produce the witness the predicate demands; conflating them under one name hid the actual metatheory"
}
